@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@user1 = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@user2 = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@request1 = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-4aaa-8aaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

### 0. Health + security headers
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### 1. SQLi regression: input is treated as text, not as SQL code
GET {{base}}/requests/search-unsafe?q=' OR '1'='1

### 2. IDOR: no X-Demo-UserId -> 401
GET {{base}}/requests/{{request1}}

### 3. IDOR: owner can read own request -> 200
GET {{base}}/requests/{{request1}}
X-Demo-UserId: {{user1}}

### 4. IDOR: another user cannot read request -> 404
GET {{base}}/requests/{{request1}}
X-Demo-UserId: {{user2}}

### 5. IDOR: another user cannot delete request -> 404
DELETE {{base}}/requests/{{request1}}
X-Demo-UserId: {{user2}}

### 6. XSS regression: create text that looks like HTML; frontend renders it with textContent
POST {{base}}/requests
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-UserId: {{user1}}

{
  "itemCode": "7777",
  "userId": "{{user1}}",
  "dateFrom": "2026-06-10",
  "dateTo": "2026-06-11",
  "comment": "<b>HTML має бути текстом</b>",
  "status": "New"
}
